&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Introducing, New from the factories of the Pactum Mercatorum....The Hunter Chassis system!
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Designed specifically to bear your field ordinance(sold separately) forward on your inexorable march in pursuit of profit. The Chassis bears you chosen ordnance system forward to support the front lines! Compatible with the bombast, Heavy Las-cannon, Multiple Rocket launcher, or Heavy Mortar system! This Chassis is already rolling out among the House Guard of the Pactum Mercatorum and is sure to provide endless hours of fun for the whole faction!
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;The Hunter Chassis System can be equipped with either Short or Long traversal legs. (Trademark P.M.)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;This state of the art traversal system removes the inefficiency of both the deployment and packing up of field batteries. Each unit can be crewed by a team of just two. And when the time comes for a tactical pivot, the Hunter Chassis System is primed and ready!
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Vox now to order or for our full catalog of ready to ship Miltech hardware or Private security services!
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Pactum Mercatorum- Seal the Pact, Prosper in Profits.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
